@TUTORIAL: Showing Fewer Jobs                   !ISFHMSG                      }
@COMMAND INPUT ===>_ISFHCMD                                                   }
}
}  On a busy system the lists are long. These show fewer jobs:
}
{  STA           }the Status panel with the jobs of class A only; STAB
}                  classes A and B
{  ST PAY*       }only the jobs whose names begin with PAY
{  PREFIX PAY*   }the same on ST, I, O and H, until you change it;
}                  PREFIX alone shows all names again
{  DEST R1       }only the jobs whose output goes to remote 1
{  H             }the held output of your own jobs; H ALL all of it
{  DA OJOB       }DA with batch jobs only
}
}  * stands for any number of characters, % for one. PREFIX and DEST
}  are kept for the next time you use SDSF: if a list is empty that
}  should not be, PREFIX ? shows what is set.
}
}
}
}
}
}
